- Mergeable sketches across batches
- Relative error ~ 1.04/√m; memory fixed by m

## Code Example
```javascript
function hllAdd(registers, x, hash) {
  const m = registers.length;
  const i = hash & (m - 1);
  const w = hash >>> Math.log2(m);
  const rank = leadingZeros(w) + 1;
  registers[i] = Math.max(registers[i], rank);
}
```

